---
source: crates/jailint/tests/rules.rs
---
warning[use_after_free]: `p` is used after the call above freed it
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/strict/resources.jai:57:10
   |
50 |     p := alloc();
   |          ------- storage derived here
   ...
56 |     f(p);
   |     ---- storage invalidated here
57 |     sink(p);
   |          ^
   |
   = help: free it after its last use, or give it a new value before using it again
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/use_after_free

warning[use_after_free]: `h` is used after the call above freed it
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/strict/resources.jai:83:16
   |
81 |     close_handle(owner, h);
   |     ---------------------- storage derived here
   |     ---------------------- storage invalidated here
   ...
83 |     use_handle(h);
   |                ^
   |
   = help: free it after its last use, or give it a new value before using it again
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/use_after_free

warning[use_after_free]: `p` is used after its foreign valid-until contract expired
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/strict/resources.jai:89:10
   |
87 |     p := provider();
   |          ---------- storage derived here
88 |     provider();
   |     ---------- storage invalidated here
89 |     sink(p);
   |          ^
   |
   = help: copy the borrowed data before the next provider call, or obtain a new result
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/use_after_free

warning[use_after_free]: `p` is used after its foreign valid-until contract expired
   --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/strict/resources.jai:95:10
    |
 93 |     p := provider();
    |          ---------- storage derived here
 94 |     refresh();
    |     --------- storage invalidated here
 95 |     sink(p);
    |          ^
    |
    = help: copy the borrowed data before the next provider call, or obtain a new result
